      "content": "839                                          HIGH STREET                                              (South Side)                                               No 145                                              (The Crown Public House) SP 9907 NW 1/30 II                          GV 2.  Late C16.  Stucco modern refacing to front.  Half hipped gable on left ith exposed magpie timber frame.  Welsh slated roof.  2 storeys, oversailing 1st floor.  5 flush sashes with glazing bars.  On left of ground floor canted sash bay window.  Carriageway on right.   Nos 137 to 147 (odd) form a group. Listing NGR: SP9925907756"
    }
